    <p class="lede">A firm that takes everything finishes nothing. If your project is on this list we
      will tell you on the first call and, where we can, point you somewhere better.</p>
    <ul class="nolist">
      <li><b>Hourly or staff-augmentation work.</b> We do not rent developers by the hour or sit in your
        standups. Fixed scope, fixed price, fixed date &mdash; or no deal.</li>
      <li><b>Anything we cannot finish in eight weeks.</b> If it is bigger than Buildout, we say so.</li>
      <li><b>Native mobile apps and app-store submission.</b> Mobile-responsive web only.</li>
      <li><b>Regulated or certified work.</b> No HIPAA, SOC&nbsp;2, PCI, or anything needing a medical or
        financial licence.</li>
      <li><b>24/7 support, on-call, weekend response or uptime SLAs.</b> Maintenance is business hours,
        two-business-day response. We do not promise uptime to anyone.</li>
      <li><b>Rescues of live production systems</b>, legacy re-writes and data migrations off old platforms.</li>
      <li><b>Design, branding, marketing, SEO, content or ads.</b> We build on a clean standard component
        library.</li>
      <li><b>Open-ended scope.</b> Changes after signature get their own price and their own date.</li>
    </ul>
